" src=\"../assets/diagrams/architecture.svg\" />"]},{"s":37892,"e":37931,"k":"block","t":"korTTY's main window has these regions:","f":[]},{"s":37947,"e":38541,"k":"block","t":"KTPH000Menu barKTPH001 — File · Edit · Connections · Configuration · Tools · AI · Teamwork · Plugins · View · Help. All features are reachable here and via KTPH002keyboard shortcutsKTPH003. A live KTPH004JobScheduler statusKTPH005 menu appears after KTPH006HelpKTPH007 when a scheduled entry is active. While a KTPH008guide translationKTPH009 runs, a progress indicator (bar, percentage and estimated time remaining) sits at the right end of the menu-bar row and stays visible even when the menu bar itself is hidden.","f":["<strong>","</strong>","<a href=\"../reference/keyboard-shortcuts.html\">","</a>","<strong>","</strong>","<em>","</em>","<a href=\"../reference/settings/translation.html\">","</a>"]},{"s":38552,"e":39318,"k":"block","t":"KTPH007Tab barKTPH008 — each SSH/Mosh session runs in its own tab. KTPH009KTPH000KTPH010+KTPH011KTPH001KTPH012 opens Quick Connect for a new tab; KTPH013KTPH002KTPH014+KTPH015KTPH003KTPH016 / KTPH017KTPH004KTPH018+KTPH019KTPH005KTPH020+KTPH021KTPH006KTPH022 switch tabs. With KTPH023Open tool windows as tabsKTPH024 enabled (KTPH025Window settingsKTPH026), management tools such as Snippets, the JobScheduler or the AI Manager open here as tabs too — in the window whose menu you used — instead of as separate windows.","f":["<kbd class=\"key-control\">Ctrl</kbd>","<kbd class=\"key-t\">T</kbd>","<kbd class=\"key-control\">Ctrl</kbd>","<kbd class=\"key-tab\">Tab</kbd>","<kbd class=\"key-control\">Ctrl</kbd>","<kbd class=\"key-shift\">Shift</kbd>","<kbd class=\"key-tab\">Tab</kbd>","<strong>","</strong>","<span class=\"keys\">","<span>","</span>","</span>","<span class=\"keys\">","<span>","</span>","</span>","<span class=\"keys\">","<span>","</span>","<span>","</span>","</span>","<strong>","</strong>","<a href=\"../reference/settings/window.html\">","</a>"]},{"s":39329,